    "steps":[
      ["Load the pan","Put the pasta nests, tomatoes, onion, spinach and garlic in a large skillet. Sprinkle over the dried herbs, chili, salt, pepper and lemon zest."],
      ["Add the liquids","Spread the tomato paste over the top, drizzle with olive oil, then pour in the cream and broth."],
      ["Simmer","Bring to a gentle simmer over medium heat, cover and cook 10 minutes, stirring now and then so the pasta separates and the paste melts into the sauce."],
